From 8b1bdb8a3cc79c70f481a1a6641bd84ec0ccaff4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: James Almer <jamrial@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Sep 2022 09:18:15 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] avformat/mpegtsenc: store extradata in the stream private
 context

This is in preparation for the following patch, which will replace it with
new extradata propagated in packets.

Signed-off-by: James Almer <jamrial@gmail.com>
---
 libavformat/mpegtsenc.c | 60 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------------
 1 file changed, 35 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libavformat/mpegtsenc.c b/libavformat/mpegtsenc.c
